# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
#  REDIRECT MAP — All About Flooring
#
#  RULE: if an old URL has a matching new page, KEEP THE SLUG
#  (define it in src/routes.jsx) instead of redirecting. A 301
#  leaks a little ranking signal on every hop. Only list URLs
#  here that are genuinely being retired or merged.
#
#  Fill this in from the Search Console "Pages" export.
#  Format:  /old-path  /new-path  301
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

# Example retirements (placeholders — delete before launch):
# /services.html            /services              301
# /hardwood-floors-old      /hardwood-flooring     301
# /index.php                /                      301

# Force one canonical host. Must match Hostinger DNS + the GBP website field.
# http://allaboutflooring.com/*  https://www.allaboutflooring.com/:splat  301!

# NOTE: no SPA fallback here on purpose. vite-react-ssg emits real HTML per
# route; a catch-all /* -> /index.html would let Google index the homepage
# under every URL on the site.

/second-location  /top-flooring-companies-st-petersburg  301
/locations/top-flooring-companies-st-petersburg/*  /top-flooring-companies-st-petersburg/:splat  301
/locations/top-flooring-companies-st-petersburg  /top-flooring-companies-st-petersburg  301
